/* Localizable.strings — Japanese (ja) stub for OpenMatch iOS.
 *
 * Every value is intentionally the literal placeholder shown below so a contributor can
 * locate every untranslated string. We do NOT ship machine
 * translations — accurate, native-speaker translations should come
 * from the community. Open a PR with translated values.
 *
 * Keep this file in lockstep with en.lproj/Localizable.strings: any
 * new key added there must be added here as a stub before merge.
 *
 * Format specifiers (%@, %lld, %.1f, %1$@ / %2$@) must be preserved
 * exactly when translating. The positional form (%1$@) lets the
 * target language reorder arguments if natural.
 */


